<title>USA: Falcon Drilling to buy two drillships.</title>
<headline>Falcon Drilling to buy two drillships.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Falcon Drilling Co Inc said Thursday it has entered into a letter of intent to acquire two drillships for $40 million, including $15 million in equity consideration.</p>
<p>The two conventionally moored drillships, Deepsea Ice and Deepsea Duchess, are to be acquired from KS Deepsea Drillships. The deal is expected to be closed by November 29.</p>
<p>Both drillships, which are rated to drill in up to 1,000 feet of water, are based in Southeast Asia.</p>
</text>
